{
  "title": "Dialer Profiles: Preview, Power, Progressive and Predictive Dialing | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "An outbound campaign is a list of people to call, and someone has to decide how each call starts, which number customers see, and which rules every call must pass. A dialer profile keeps those answers in one place, so one profile can serve many campaigns. This video explains the four dialing modes and walks through creating a profile in the CrestApps Contact Center for Orchard Core.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why dialer profiles exist\n• Preview, Power, Progressive and Predictive dialing\n• The features and the menu\n• Creating a profile: General, Dialing, Caller ID and Compliance\n• How teams use profiles",
